{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a clean, minimal FAQ section identical to the reference.
    
    ⚠️ DO NOT change any text, wording, punctuation, emojis, icons, spacing, or hierarchy.
    ⚠️ DO NOT rewrite, summarize, or optimize the answers.
    
    SECTION HEADER (centered)
    
    Title:
    ❓ COMMON QUESTIONS
    
    FAQ STRUCTURE
    
    Display a vertical list of questions and answers, styled like an accordion or expandable FAQ, matching the reference layout.
    
    QUESTIONS & ANSWERS
    
    (Content must remain exactly the same)
    
    ▾ Safe with other supplements?
    Generally well-tolerated with most common supplements. Important: If you're on medication—especially for blood sugar—check with your doctor first.
    
    ▾ When will I notice something?
    Most people notice a change around week 3. Week 1–2 is getting started, Week 2–3 digestion improves, Week 3–4 energy stabilizes.
    
    ▾ Why take both together?
    Berberine supports natural energy metabolism. Akkermansia supports gut health. Together = better results than alone.
    
    ▾ Can I stop after 90 days?
    Yes. Many people continue, drop to a maintenance dose, or cycle it. You decide what feels right.
    
    ▾ What about shipping?
    Ships in 72 hours (US/Canada/UK). Full refund if not happy within 30 days.
    
    DESIGN & STYLE RULES
    
    White background
    
    Clean, minimal, trustworthy supplement-brand aesthetic
    
    Questions slightly bolder than answers
    
    Subtle divider lines between items
    
    Green arrow / caret icon before each question (same style as reference)
    
    Text left-aligned
    
    INTERACTION
    
    Questions can be expandable/collapsible
    
    Default state matches the reference (simple, non-animated)
    
    No aggressive animations
    
    RESPONSIVENESS (MANDATORY)
    
    Desktop: centered column, comfortable reading width
    
    Tablet: same layout with reduced spacing
    
    Mobile:
    
    Full-width FAQ
    
    Easy tap targets for questions
    
    No horizontal scrolling
    
    TECHNICAL CONSTRAINTS
    
    Use semantic HTML (details / summary or accessible accordion)
    
    Mobile-first responsive CSS
    
    Fully compatible with Shopify Dawn theme
    
    No JavaScript required
    
    The final result must visually match the reference exactly, only adapting spacing for smaller screens.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-faq-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px 20px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-faq-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-faq-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.header_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-faq-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ai-faq-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    border-bottom: {{ block.settings.divider_thickness }}px solid {{ block.settings.divider_color }};
  }

  .ai-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .ai-faq-question-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    padding: {{ block.settings.item_padding }}px 0;
    text-align: left;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.question_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.question_color }};
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ai-faq-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    margin-top: 4px;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .ai-faq-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    fill: {{ block.settings.icon_color }};
  }

  .ai-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}[open] .ai-faq-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }

  .ai-faq-question-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .ai-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 0 0 {{ block.settings.item_padding }}px 28px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.answer_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.answer_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-faq-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.title_size }}px * 0.85);
    }

    .ai-faq-question-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.question_size }}px * 0.95);
      padding: {{ block.settings.item_padding | times: 0.8 }}px 0;
    }

    .ai-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.answer_size }}px * 0.95);
      padding: 0 0 {{ block.settings.item_padding | times: 0.8 }}px 28px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<faq-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-faq-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-faq-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-faq-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <h2 class="ai-faq-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.section_title }}</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-faq-list-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <details class="ai-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <summary class="ai-faq-question-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <span class="ai-faq-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M8 11L3 6h10l-5 5z"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span class="ai-faq-question-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Safe with other supplements?</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="ai-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          Generally well-tolerated with most common supplements. Important: If you're on medication—especially for blood sugar—check with your doctor first.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="ai-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <summary class="ai-faq-question-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <span class="ai-faq-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M8 11L3 6h10l-5 5z"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span class="ai-faq-question-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">When will I notice something?</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="ai-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          Most people notice a change around week 3. Week 1–2 is getting started, Week 2–3 digestion improves, Week 3–4 energy stabilizes.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="ai-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <summary class="ai-faq-question-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <span class="ai-faq-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M8 11L3 6h10l-5 5z"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span class="ai-faq-question-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Why take both together?</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="ai-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          Berberine supports natural energy metabolism. Akkermansia supports gut health. Together = better results than alone.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="ai-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <summary class="ai-faq-question-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <span class="ai-faq-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M8 11L3 6h10l-5 5z"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span class="ai-faq-question-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Can I stop after 90 days?</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="ai-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          Yes. Many people continue, drop to a maintenance dose, or cycle it. You decide what feels right.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="ai-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <summary class="ai-faq-question-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <span class="ai-faq-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M8 11L3 6h10l-5 5z"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span class="ai-faq-question-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">What about shipping?</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="ai-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          Ships in 72 hours (US/Canada/UK). Full refund if not happy within 30 days.
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</faq-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class FaqSection{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        const details = this.querySelectorAll('details');
        
        details.forEach(detail => {
          detail.addEventListener('toggle', () => {
            if (detail.open) {
              details.forEach(otherDetail => {
                if (otherDetail !== detail && otherDetail.open) {
                  otherDetail.open = false;
                }
              });
            }
          });
        });
      }
    }

    customElements.define('faq-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}', FaqSection{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
